      "audit_comment" = "the Table 25a grid, the static characteristics: the eight inland vessels (kayak, small canoe, small rowboat, coracle, large canoe, large rowboat, small barge, large barge) x the fourteen columns - the length and width ranges, the passenger and gold-piece capacity, the encumbrance range (a 0 maximum marks the large barge open-ended 10000+), the startup and hull-value ranges, and the draught split into numerator and denominator",
      "data" = { { 8, 12, 2, 3, 1, 1000, 600, 800, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 4 }, { 10, 15, 2, 3, 2, 2500, 700, 900, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 4 }, { 8, 12, 2, 4, 2, 2000, 700, 1000, 1, 3, 1, 3, 1, 2 }, { 10, 15, 3, 5, 2, 2000, 900, 1200, 1, 3, 1, 2, 1, 2 }, { 15, 20, 2, 3, 2, 4000, 1000, 1200, 1, 3, 2, 3, 1, 3 }, { 15, 20, 3, 4, 4, 4000, 1200, 1600, 2, 5, 2, 4, 3, 4 }, { 15, 20, 8, 12, 4, 6000, 4000, 6000, 2, 6, 1, 6, 3, 4 }, { 25, 45, 12, 20, 6, 7500, 10000, 0, 5, 10, 2, 8, 1, 1 } },
    }, {
